  "notes": "First release.\n\n### Added\n\n- Watch UPSs through Network UPS Tools: one on this computer, a Raspberry Pi on the network, or every UPS found on the network on one screen.\n- Sign in to the Connect cloud to see your account's customers, sites and devices, with remote diagnostics, an event timeline and live mode.\n- Mains, battery and bypass status, battery charge, load, voltage and frequency, with a log of power events.\n- Run a UPS's commands and record battery tests with the voltage curve.\n- Menu bar / system tray status, notifications for power changes and devices that stop reporting, and start at login.\n- Automatic updates: the app looks for new versions at startup and every few hours, and installs them when you choose.",
